    <!-- Cooling is airflow, never a snowflake: the cooler blows air. -->
    <x:String x:Key="IconCoolingData">M3 17.5 C6 16 6.5 12 9.2 9.8 C11.2 8.1 13.3 8 15.2 8.7 M5.2 21 C8.3 18.8 8.7 15.1 11.5 12.8 C14 10.8 17.2 10.8 19.3 12.4 M3.2 12.2 C5.1 10.8 5.5 7.8 7.7 5.9 C9.8 4.1 12 4 13.8 4.8</x:String>

